1
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:50,159
Comrade 92973.

2
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,599
Please record.

3
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:55,039
6019

4
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,360
0545

5
00:02:59,879 --> 00:03:01,759
2434

6
00:03:03,639 --> 00:03:05,400
0826

7
00:03:10,159 --> 00:03:11,319
Northbound mission accomplished.

8
00:03:11,759 --> 00:03:12,840
Effective immediately,

9
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:15,080
you are the Courier for the high-level target.

10
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:20,719
Boss,

11
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:22,000
the project documents you requested.

12
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:22,800
Let's talk inside.

13
00:03:42,719 --> 00:03:45,159
Boss, your place is beautiful.

14
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,840
What's beautiful about it?

15
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,840
It's so spacious and tasteful.

16
00:03:52,439 --> 00:03:54,560
It's nothing like a typical rich person's home.

17
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:57,680
How many rich people's homes have you been to?

18
00:03:59,319 --> 00:04:00,560
I... I haven't been to any.

19
00:04:00,919 --> 00:04:02,280
But I know...

20
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,240
Rich people all like this kind of wood.

21
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,080
You can tell right away this wood is expensive.

22
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:06,840
Right?

23
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,919
Tea or coffee?

24
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:09,800
Coffee.

25
00:04:11,759 --> 00:04:12,919
Is it hot? Let me take it.

26
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:14,039
It's fine, it's fine, it's fine.

27
00:04:14,039 --> 00:04:16,279
I added milk foam and sugar for you.

28
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,480
It shouldn't be so bitter now.

29
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,519
Give it a try.

30
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,639
Thank you, Boss.

31
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,600
It really isn't bitter.

32
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,199
Is it good?

33
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:26,959
It's good. It's different from last time.

34
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:43,800
Over here today.

35
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:45,759
There's a lot of stuff over there today, too.

36
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,680
Let's hurry over there.

37
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,480
Let's go gather up ahead.

38
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:48,279
Okay.

39
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,360
There's some over there.

40
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:51,319
Why is there a notice?

41
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,360
Hurry up! Hurry up!

42
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,399
Hurry!

43
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:56,680
What does this say?

44
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:57,920
I don't know what it is.

45
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,000
What is it?

46
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:00,759
Look, what is this?

47
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:01,759
Looks like a notice.

48
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:02,439
A notice?

49
00:05:11,439 --> 00:05:12,160
Latest News:

50
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,319
Early this morning,

51
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,439
our military's operations in the Taiwan, China Strait,

52
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:16,959
the surface-to-surface missile firing exercises,

53
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:19,560
achieved complete success in the first round.

54
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:22,199
Participating troops fired three surface-to-surface missiles,

55
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,800
all accurately hitting targets in designated waters.

56
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,680
This exercise demonstrated our military personnel's

57
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,040
excellent combat readiness

58
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,439
and high fighting spirit,

59
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,720
showing that our military has the absolute resolve,

60
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:35,720
means, and capability to safeguard the motherland's unity

61
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:38,319
and defend national sovereignty and territorial integrity.

62
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,040
There's going to be a war here!

63
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,360
All flights have been grounded!

64
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:52,199
How should I know what to do?

65
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,399
Stop pushing, everyone! Stop pushing!

66
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,480
This isn't our responsibility!

67
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,399
All the US dollars are exchanged. What about the stocks?

68
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:10,920
Dump them.

69
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,079
Dump them all.

70
00:06:13,079 --> 00:06:13,959
Dump everything.

71
00:06:13,959 --> 00:06:15,360
Just trust me.

72
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:16,519
But...

73
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:18,439
Wait and see what a mess the stock market will be tomorrow.

74
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,920
Either take the pain now,

75
00:06:20,439 --> 00:06:22,120
or it'll hurt even more tomorrow.

76
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:22,720
You choose.

77
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:25,160
Dump them all? Have you lost your mind?

78
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,879
All the smart people in Taiwan, China are dumping them!

79
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:29,240
Okay, okay. I'll head back now.

80
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,600
Don't keep a single share.

81
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:32,279
The food is almost ready.

82
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,639
Should we wait for you?

83
00:06:33,639 --> 00:06:36,199
Forget about eating! Do you know how much trouble this is?

84
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:37,319
Next time, you come here yourself!

85
00:06:37,319 --> 00:06:38,199
Okay, okay. I'm hanging up.

86
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:42,519
Mom.

87
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,040
Time to eat.

88
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,720
Don't worry.

89
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:01,160
The missiles used in the mainland's military drills

90
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,560
are all blanks.

91
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:04,879
They wouldn't dare attack Taiwan, China.

92
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:07,399
He claims the mainland's military exercises

93
00:07:07,399 --> 00:07:09,680
and missile tests are just to scare people.

94
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,800
It's a complete bluff.

95
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:13,120
He also confidently stated that

96
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:15,160
even if the PLA really crossed the strait,

97
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,480
they are already prepared.

98
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:17,839
What's going on?

99
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,000
Nothing, nothing.

100
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:19,639
I was careless.

101
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:20,480
Breaking brings good luck.

102
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:22,519
You've been clumsy since you were a kid.

103
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:25,720
Your dad bought this when he married me.

104
00:07:25,839 --> 00:07:28,279
And you broke the very last one.

105
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:29,720
If he finds out,

106
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,000
he'll scold you to death in your dreams tonight.

107
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:42,720
Did everyone watch Lee Teng-hui's speech?

108
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,600
We did.

109
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,560
The message from the provincial department is

110
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,319
Taiwan, China wants to show its hand.

111
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,319
They want to raise the stakes.

112
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,279
Then we will round up

113
00:07:50,279 --> 00:07:51,600
every gambler at the table.

114
00:07:51,639 --> 00:07:52,439
We are launching ahead of schedule,

115
00:07:52,439 --> 00:07:53,800
Operation Spring Thunder No. 1.

116
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:54,879
Our bureau will lead the charge.

117
00:07:54,879 --> 00:07:56,519
We must be steady, accurate, and ruthless.

118
00:07:56,519 --> 00:07:57,560
We must deliver a resounding blow.

119
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,759
All divisions and teams,

120
00:07:58,959 --> 00:08:00,000
formulate your action plans.

121
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,399
Submit them within a week.

122
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:01,839
Yes, sir.

123
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:02,240
Yes, sir.

124
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:04,959
Old Wei, looking for a needle in a haystack with your magnet,

125
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:06,360
have you found anything?

126
00:08:07,959 --> 00:08:10,439
These are the current instructions from above.

127
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,759
I need your support.

128
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:13,959
I know.

129
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:15,720
I'll handle it.

130
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:17,959
I'm counting on you.

131
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,480
You're sleepy?

132
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:49,159
Just go home and catch up on sleep.

133
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,000
Driving for so long,

134
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,200
on mountain roads...

135
00:08:52,759 --> 00:08:54,399
What did Bell invent

136
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:55,919
the telephone for?

137
00:08:59,679 --> 00:09:00,559
Sir,

138
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,519
making a public speech

139
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,639
and exposing information,

140
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,759
did he even give you a heads-up?

141
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:07,840
This is going to get people killed!

142
00:09:07,879 --> 00:09:09,360
What about our intelligence officers?

143
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:10,399
They are our own people.

144
00:09:10,399 --> 00:09:12,559
They swore oaths before you and me.

145
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,120
I sent them to the mainland,

146
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,440
putting them in harm's way.

147
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,440
How am I supposed to answer to them?

148
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:17,840
Why do we keep secrets?

149
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,120
Because once a secret is leaked,

150
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:20,840
a whole chain of people will lose their heads.

151
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,879
On my way here, I also heard

152
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,320
that the stock market in Taiwan, China

153
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,000
has completely bottomed out.

154
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:31,320
The guys in there are all buying the dip.

155
00:09:31,399 --> 00:09:32,559
What are they thinking?

156
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:34,000
They're keeping even us in the dark!

157
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,279
Did you really not know

158
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,879
about these things?

159
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:40,200
How do I explain this to Lin Kanshan and his guys?

160
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,600
I go to the mainland for intelligence,

161
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:43,440
and I have to bow down to scientists,

162
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:44,960
try to flatter them,

163
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:45,559
deceive them,

164
00:09:45,559 --> 00:09:46,519
and make the lies convincing.

165
00:09:46,519 --> 00:09:48,120
They're going to curse my ancestors!

166
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,960
How can I have the face to see them again?

167
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:52,000
Who is ever going to believe what we say?

168
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:55,320
I can quit.

169
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:56,480
I can even leave the party!

170
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,759
You can't usually get this.

171
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:01,679
Have a little.

172
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,440
Are you done talking?

173
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:07,679
If you're done, I'll take you inside right now.

174
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:09,320
You can curse them out yourself.

175
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:11,559
Stop making your people out

176
00:10:11,559 --> 00:10:13,240
to be so noble.

177
00:10:13,399 --> 00:10:16,080
For all we know, they're out having a good time right now.

178
00:10:16,279 --> 00:10:18,960
How many of them are scamming us for funds over there?

179
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:20,120
Filing false and fake reports,

180
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:22,159
making up outdated intelligence.

181
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:24,720
This year's is the same as last year's.

182
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:27,080
Last year's is the same as the year before's.

183
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:30,200
They don't even change a single punctuation mark!

184
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:32,200
Living it up every day over there...

185
00:10:32,279 --> 00:10:33,320
Do they have any shame?

186
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:36,000
You really think I'm so senile that I don't know?

187
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,759
"Deep behind enemy lines"?

188
00:10:37,879 --> 00:10:41,000
Like the Communists in Nanjing or Chongqing back in the day?

189
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:43,000
You don't know how to answer to them?

190
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:44,600
I'll teach you.

191
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,559
Intelligence work is just four words:

192
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,759
"Take what you need."

193
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:50,519
You tell that clueless "Shan" guy,

194
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,960
tell him to come back!

195
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,399
See if he's willing to come back.

196
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:55,120
If everyone comes back,

197
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,720
what will you use to get yourself promoted?

198
00:10:58,799 --> 00:11:01,159
And stop going to my hometown,

199
00:11:01,159 --> 00:11:03,600
gifting my mother gold earrings and bracelets.

200
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,320
My mother doesn't need that.

201
00:11:08,399 --> 00:11:09,600
What is a politician?

202
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:12,200
A politician is a hand.

203
00:11:13,039 --> 00:11:14,919
Whatever shape it molds you into,

204
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:16,480
that is what you are.

205
00:11:16,759 --> 00:11:17,600
You're tough?

206
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,279
If you're tough, then bring me intelligence!

207
00:11:19,399 --> 00:11:20,559
You can go inside right now.

208
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:21,559
Sneak in,

209
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,559
climb to the top,

210
00:11:22,799 --> 00:11:25,000
and mold Taiwan, China into the shape you want.

211
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:25,879
And you...

212
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:27,720
what are you yelling at me for?

213
00:11:27,879 --> 00:11:30,000
Don't come lecturing me with your flawed logic!

214
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:31,519
Do you think everywhere is the same?

215
00:11:31,799 --> 00:11:34,120
You think you're still in college,

216
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,080
taking a debate class?

217
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,000
You just don't get it.

218
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:52,440
This area will be our staff cafeteria in the future.

219
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:52,919
Right.

220
00:11:52,919 --> 00:11:53,440
Over here.

221
00:11:53,519 --> 00:11:54,960
This entire area.

222
00:11:55,159 --> 00:11:56,559
Later, we'll build

223
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,159
another dormitory over here.

224
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,399
This won't do.

225
00:12:00,679 --> 00:12:01,480
Boss Lin.

226
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:03,559
We gave you such a large piece of land.

227
00:12:03,559 --> 00:12:04,399
How long has it been?

228
00:12:04,399 --> 00:12:05,399
Construction is too slow.

229
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:06,720
You need to learn how to do the math.

230
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,840
Three people working for ten days

231
00:12:07,919 --> 00:12:09,120
isn't as good as ten people working for three.

232
00:12:09,279 --> 00:12:10,120
Try it and see.

233
00:12:10,279 --> 00:12:11,120
The faster the construction,

234
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,039
the faster you make money.

235
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,919
You need to distinguish the big gains from the small.

236
00:12:13,919 --> 00:12:14,679
Yes, yes, yes.

237
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,279
I'll add more workers tomorrow.

238
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:17,799
I guarantee it'll be completed next month.

239
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:18,879
Listen to the leaders,

240
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:20,399
and you'll make big money and eat well!

241
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:21,960
Boss Lin is right.

242
00:12:22,679 --> 00:12:23,679
This way, please, sir.

243
00:12:23,759 --> 00:12:24,279
Let's go, let's go.

244
00:12:24,279 --> 00:12:24,799
Mayor Xie.

245
00:12:24,799 --> 00:12:25,600
Watch your step.

246
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:34,159
What's wrong, sir?

247
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:38,799
Boss Lin.

248
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:41,519
You can't just take what's offered,

249
00:12:42,159 --> 00:12:43,279
and then bite the hand that feeds you.

250
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:50,000
Any compatriot from Taiwan, China, who comes here

251
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,320
is a brother.

252
00:12:51,759 --> 00:12:52,960
You can't act like Lee Teng-hui.

253
00:12:53,919 --> 00:12:55,559
Do you know what he just said?

254
00:12:56,279 --> 00:12:58,600
He said the mainland is full of their people.

255
00:12:58,919 --> 00:12:59,919
They are everywhere.

256
00:13:00,559 --> 00:13:02,639
There's so much intel you can shovel it.

257
00:13:03,159 --> 00:13:04,120
Saying things like that,

258
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:06,200
he's not afraid of affecting you businessmen from Taiwan, China.

259
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:08,960
He's a lunatic.

260
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:11,519
He's been acting crazy on TV lately.

261
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:13,000
I don't even bother watching him.

262
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,080
I suspect he's had too much fake liquor.

263
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:23,200
Yes, yes, ignore him.

264
00:13:24,279 --> 00:13:25,279
Military drills are one thing,

265
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,279
business is another.

266
00:13:26,600 --> 00:13:27,919
We still need to work together

267
00:13:27,919 --> 00:13:29,000
and focus on construction.

268
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:29,919
Yes, yes.

269
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:31,919
This way, please. Watch your step.

270
00:13:31,919 --> 00:13:33,000
Careful, careful, Mayor Xie.

271
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:34,080
Careful, careful.

272
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,399
This way, please.

273
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:12,159
What is it now?

274
00:14:12,159 --> 00:14:13,039
Don't sell the stocks.

275
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:13,679
Huh?

276
00:14:13,679 --> 00:14:14,919
Buy back everything we sold.

277
00:14:14,919 --> 00:14:15,600
We're not selling?

278
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,600
Right. Buy the dip.

279
00:14:16,879 --> 00:14:17,960
How much should we buy?

280
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,279
Buy as much as we can afford.

281
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,519
What do you mean?

282
00:14:20,519 --> 00:14:21,720
We're using all our money to buy stocks?

283
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:23,399
All means all.

284
00:14:23,399 --> 00:14:24,440
Every last penny.

285
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,960
Why do you keep changing your mind?

286
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:26,919
Just listen to me.

287
00:14:26,919 --> 00:14:28,120
Just buy when I tell you to.

288
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:29,000
All right, all right.

289
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,200
I'll explain everything when I get back.

290
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:30,879
Seriously.

291
00:14:30,879 --> 00:14:31,639
Okay, that's it.

292
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:28,879
Connecting incoming call 92973.

293
00:15:29,279 --> 00:15:31,159
Didn't you say we'd stop doing things "at whatever cost"?

294
00:15:31,159 --> 00:15:33,120
You said it. So what am I now?

295
00:15:33,399 --> 00:15:34,799
Am I the "whatever" or the "cost"?

296
00:15:35,159 --> 00:15:36,240
He wants "Taiwan independence."

297
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,080
Who cares if he wants independence or not!

298
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,559
You leak intel on a whim.

299
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:40,200
What happens to us if we are exposed on purpose?

300
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,519
Are we not human beings?

301
00:15:43,919 --> 00:15:45,360
Are you even listening to me?

302
00:15:45,879 --> 00:15:47,480
Lin Kanshan, listen to me.

303
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:49,480
What the higher-ups say is their business.

304
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:51,840
Save your complaints until you're a higher-up.

305
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:54,159
If you're scared, you can submit your resignation.

306
00:15:54,159 --> 00:15:55,639
But think it through.

307
00:15:55,639 --> 00:15:57,639
What can you even do if you go back to Taipei?

308
00:15:59,399 --> 00:16:00,120
No, wait.

309
00:16:00,399 --> 00:16:01,519
I'm not thinking about resigning.

310
00:16:01,519 --> 00:16:02,799
That's not what I meant.

311
00:16:03,039 --> 00:16:04,679
I just didn't finish what I was saying.

312
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,639
What I meant was,

313
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,559
at times like this, we must persevere even more.

314
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:10,879
Like you said.

315
00:16:11,279 --> 00:16:12,440
Sailing against the current.

316
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,360
If you don't advance, you fall behind.

317
00:16:14,039 --> 00:16:15,720
You should have known the day you came out here

318
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:18,039
to be ready for any emergencies at any time.

319
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:20,440
Did you really think you were on vacation?

320
00:16:20,799 --> 00:16:21,679
I get it.

321
00:16:22,519 --> 00:16:24,320
Don't call here again for a while.

322
00:16:24,519 --> 00:16:26,559
Just keep playing the Taiwanese businessman.

323
00:16:26,919 --> 00:16:29,039
We will contact you if needed.

324
00:16:29,759 --> 00:16:30,279
Okay.

325
00:16:50,919 --> 00:16:51,919
Everyone who came today,

326
00:16:52,279 --> 00:16:52,960
and everyone seated here,

327
00:16:53,399 --> 00:16:55,360
make up the members of the task force.

328
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:57,279
To maintain secrecy,

329
00:16:57,559 --> 00:16:59,279
it mainly consists of Division 2.

330
00:16:59,279 --> 00:17:00,639
Jinlan will remain on secondment.

331
00:17:00,639 --> 00:17:01,639
With a flexible schedule.

332
00:17:01,879 --> 00:17:03,879
There have been many intelligence leaks lately.

333
00:17:03,879 --> 00:17:05,000
Some are military,

334
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,440
and some are technological.

335
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:08,240
The focus is Institute 761,

336
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,920
and the core is the missile incident.

337
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,160
Others include

338
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:12,359
ports, maps,

339
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:14,000
troops, and military regions.

340
00:17:17,839 --> 00:17:18,519
Re...

341
00:17:18,519 --> 00:17:19,160
Reporting!

342
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:21,160
I went to the provincial department for Document 36.

343
00:17:21,279 --> 00:17:22,680
I got a page halfway and rushed back.

344
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,039
Traffic was a bit heavy, so I'm late.

345
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:24,920
Come in.

346
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:33,039
Now that everyone is here,

347
00:17:34,039 --> 00:17:35,240
we will begin the operation immediately.

348
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:36,680
From now on,

349
00:17:36,759 --> 00:17:38,279
the target monitored by Ma Qi's team

350
00:17:38,440 --> 00:17:39,880
will be wiretapped by Jinlan.

351
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,480
The case is officially opened,

352
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,440
with focused surveillance.

353
00:17:45,359 --> 00:17:46,480
Starting today,

354
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:47,880
your cover identity

355
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:50,599
is a tour guide at Shenzhou Strait Travel Agency.

356
00:17:51,319 --> 00:17:53,799
You transferred from the head office less than 6 months ago.

357
00:17:53,799 --> 00:17:56,000
The exact date is based on your pay slips.

358
00:17:56,359 --> 00:17:57,640
Who was your mentor?

359
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:58,559
How long did you train under them?

360
00:17:58,759 --> 00:18:00,920
Which routes did you cover during your internship?

361
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,440
How do you get off-the-books income?

362
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:03,519
How do you negotiate kickbacks?

363
00:18:03,519 --> 00:18:04,680
How are the kickbacks paid to you?

364
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:06,759
In installments, or settled at the end of the month?

365
00:18:06,799 --> 00:18:07,319
Also,

366
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,200
for any place you have visited,

367
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:10,680
what is the official commentary?

368
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:11,960
And what are the folk legends?

369
00:18:12,039 --> 00:18:13,160
Which parts quote historical texts,

370
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:14,599
and which are hearsay?

371
00:18:14,599 --> 00:18:15,880
All the details

372
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:16,960
must match up.

373
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,559
If you forget even one thing,

374
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,160
it will cause huge trouble later.

375
00:18:21,279 --> 00:18:22,799
Invoices cannot be issued from here.

376
00:18:22,799 --> 00:18:24,200
They must be mailed from the head office.

377
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,920
Ms. Zhang, who used to handle this,

378
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,200
has extremely high blood pressure,

379
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:29,039
so she works from home now.

380
00:18:29,359 --> 00:18:31,680
Therefore, you have never even met her.

381
00:18:31,920 --> 00:18:33,599
You only know she exists.

382
00:18:35,400 --> 00:18:36,920
You bring your own lunch every day at noon

383
00:18:37,759 --> 00:18:39,480
because a tour guide's schedule is irregular

384
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:41,160
and there is no cafeteria here.

385
00:18:42,279 --> 00:18:43,680
How much do you know about tour guides?

386
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,359
They always keep stomach medicine in their bags.

387
00:18:45,359 --> 00:18:46,640
They usually only wear sneakers.

388
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,680
Their calf muscles must be strong.

389
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:49,880
A quick mind can earn more off-the-books income.

390
00:18:51,559 --> 00:18:54,400
As for how the boss lands big contracts,

391
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,799
and why, with so many travel agencies,

392
00:18:55,799 --> 00:18:57,200
and so many wanting to do tourism,

393
00:18:57,359 --> 00:18:58,799
only we are issued the

394
00:18:58,799 --> 00:19:00,279
Hong Kong, China, Macau, China, and Taiwan, China permits,

395
00:19:00,279 --> 00:19:01,279
as for these matters,

396
00:19:01,279 --> 00:19:02,839
if you don't know, just say so.

397
00:19:02,839 --> 00:19:04,119
If you can't answer,

398
00:19:04,119 --> 00:19:05,839
just say you're always out running routes

399
00:19:05,839 --> 00:19:06,920
and are rarely at the office.

400
00:19:07,319 --> 00:19:08,640
You must never make things up.

401
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,279
We aren't afraid of you being stumped,

402
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:11,759
we are most afraid of you lying.

403
00:19:15,799 --> 00:19:17,680
How do you know all this in such detail?

404
00:19:19,440 --> 00:19:22,279
I worked here for two and a half years before.

405
00:19:22,279 --> 00:19:23,160
As an accountant.

406
00:19:24,119 --> 00:19:25,880
Which route do I cover the most?

407
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:28,839
I mean,

408
00:19:29,039 --> 00:19:30,359
I should know the street vendors

409
00:19:30,359 --> 00:19:31,559
along the route, right?

410
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:49,119
Even someone half-blind could see it coming.

411
00:19:49,119 --> 00:19:50,599
The KMT is going to win the election.

412
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:52,400
What are these people still up to?

413
00:19:52,559 --> 00:19:55,039
It's just like neighbors having a fight.

414
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:57,240
Who would willingly admit defeat?

415
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:58,880
That's just how elections go.

416
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:01,160
No matter how low the support, they have to build some hype.

417
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:02,519
Keep things lively.

418
00:20:02,519 --> 00:20:03,880
Just treat it as celebrating the New Year.

419
00:20:04,119 --> 00:20:05,920
Do you know why every general election

420
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:07,279
is held around the turn of the year?

421
00:20:07,839 --> 00:20:09,440
It's right during the pro baseball off-season.

422
00:20:09,799 --> 00:20:11,799
The weather is cold and there's nothing to do.

423
00:20:11,920 --> 00:20:13,799
The public needs a way to vent, too.

424
00:20:13,799 --> 00:20:15,480
With all their dissatisfaction with the government,

425
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:17,960
if you don't let them shout and vent it out,

426
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:19,880
it's going to cause other problems sooner or later.

427
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:22,559
It'll never end.

428
00:20:22,559 --> 00:20:23,519
I'm not waiting anymore.

429
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,559
Are you coming home for dinner tonight?

430
00:20:26,559 --> 00:20:27,599
Of course I am.

431
00:20:27,759 --> 00:20:29,960
When has that old man ever controlled me?

432
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:32,039
Then they should've asked you to meet up earlier.

433
00:20:32,039 --> 00:20:33,319
Always keeping you out so late.

434
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:34,720
Nobody's going to check on him tomorrow.

435
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:35,839
He'll be late for work.

436
00:20:35,839 --> 00:20:36,759
Come back early.

437
00:20:41,359 --> 00:20:44,079
Welcome to Pacific Nightclub.

438
00:20:45,039 --> 00:20:46,559
Welcome.

439
00:20:48,279 --> 00:20:49,039
Brother Qi.

440
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:51,119
I came here from Taipei,

441
00:20:51,119 --> 00:20:53,160
and my elders gave me some earnest advice.

442
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:54,480
"If you're dumb,

443
00:20:54,960 --> 00:20:56,960
you need to follow someone smart.

444
00:20:57,240 --> 00:20:58,960
When they eat meat, you drink the soup.

445
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:00,119
You get rich together."

446
00:21:00,599 --> 00:21:03,079
Brother Qi, please show me the ropes.

447
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,200
Let's eat meat together,

448
00:21:08,559 --> 00:21:09,440
and drink soup together.

449
00:21:11,559 --> 00:21:12,799
We're all good brothers.

450
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:14,240
We're all family.

451
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:21,480
Brother Qi, there are so many people in the government.

452
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,799
They all wear the same clothes.

453
00:21:22,799 --> 00:21:24,240
How am I supposed to know who manages who,

454
00:21:24,240 --> 00:21:25,160
who fears who,

455
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:26,240
who ignores who,

456
00:21:26,519 --> 00:21:27,519
or who's out to get who?

457
00:21:27,920 --> 00:21:28,680
When I first arrived,

458
00:21:28,680 --> 00:21:30,039
his brother-in-law told me,

459
00:21:30,359 --> 00:21:31,519
"Listen and watch more,

460
00:21:31,519 --> 00:21:32,880
talk and speak less."

461
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:35,559
How was I supposed to understand that?

462
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:37,079
Teach me, brother.

463
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,240
For the exact same matter,

464
00:21:41,240 --> 00:21:42,359
you don't need to worry about how to do it.

465
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:43,880
It mainly depends on who's doing it.

466
00:21:44,039 --> 00:21:45,200
If they're willing to do it for you,

467
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:46,240
then it's easy.

468
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,400
If they're not willing,

469
00:21:47,400 --> 00:21:48,519
then it's difficult.

470
00:21:48,960 --> 00:21:50,359
As long as it gets done, that's what matters.

471
00:21:54,599 --> 00:21:56,039
You got it so quickly!

472
00:21:56,279 --> 00:21:57,720
Starting from this very second,

473
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:58,519
CT scanners,

474
00:21:58,519 --> 00:21:59,799
radiation equipment, MRI machines,

475
00:21:59,799 --> 00:22:00,799
including yours from Taiwan, China,

476
00:22:00,799 --> 00:22:02,440
all large medical equipment...

477
00:22:02,599 --> 00:22:03,559
Across the whole province,

478
00:22:03,759 --> 00:22:06,160
as long as county or city hospitals will take them,

479
00:22:06,720 --> 00:22:07,960
they're available for lease anytime.

480
00:22:08,160 --> 00:22:08,799
Great.

481
00:22:09,559 --> 00:22:11,000
Taipei, Kaohsiung, Hsinchu...

482
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,160
I'll handle all the hospitals there.

483
00:22:12,240 --> 00:22:14,000
Their equipment is going to be replaced anyway.

484
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:15,720
Boss Lin, please take a look.

485
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,200
Point one of Article three,

486
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:19,319
Point three of Article six,

487
00:22:19,319 --> 00:22:21,359
and points three and six of Article seven,

488
00:22:21,359 --> 00:22:22,759
have all been revised as you requested.

489
00:22:22,759 --> 00:22:24,000
If the contract looks fine,

490
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:25,319
we can sign it today.

491
00:22:26,039 --> 00:22:27,720
With Brother Qi here, there's no problem.

492
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:37,440
Brother Chun.

493
00:22:38,480 --> 00:22:39,519
Brother Qi said,

494
00:22:39,519 --> 00:22:40,400
"Let's get rich together."

495
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:41,839
Brother Qi.

496
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,319
This is a little token of my appreciation.

497
00:22:49,559 --> 00:22:50,759
Brother Qi, here's to you.

498
00:23:05,200 --> 00:23:06,519
Call the girls over.

499
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:09,839
Be careful.

500
00:23:11,079 --> 00:23:11,920
Come on, come on! Over here!

501
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:12,799
Careful.

502
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:16,680
Bro.

503
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:17,640
Having fun?

504
00:23:18,079 --> 00:23:19,000
Waiter!

505
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:20,519
Make sure you come tomorrow.

506
00:23:20,519 --> 00:23:22,160
Where's the complimentary fruit platter?

507
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:22,680
Hurry up.

508
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:23,680
Coming, coming! Right away!

509
00:23:35,079 --> 00:23:36,440
No shoulder massage for me?

510
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:38,039
Promoted to manager, huh?

511
00:23:38,079 --> 00:23:39,000
Boss Lin, you're here.

512
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:40,039
Still putting on an act.

513
00:23:40,599 --> 00:23:42,160
You saw me but didn't come over.

514
00:23:42,720 --> 00:23:44,119
Afraid I'd ask for the watch?

515
00:23:44,119 --> 00:23:45,000
No, no.

516
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:45,880
Not at all.

517
00:23:46,039 --> 00:23:47,599
They just asked me to deliver a fruit platter.

518
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,400
To tell you the truth,

519
00:23:51,880 --> 00:23:54,039
that watch of yours keeps time pretty well.

520
00:23:54,279 --> 00:23:56,519
Aside from not being waterproof, it looks quite real.

521
00:23:56,799 --> 00:23:57,799
How much did you pay for it?

522
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:00,880
And your girlfriend even let you be my driver.

523
00:24:01,519 --> 00:24:02,920
You wouldn't swap out my engine

524
00:24:02,920 --> 00:24:04,839
and wheels for plastic ones, would you?

525
00:24:05,799 --> 00:24:06,319
No, of course not.

526
00:24:07,759 --> 00:24:09,240
I heard you drove for the government.

527
00:24:09,519 --> 00:24:10,480
What level?

528
00:24:12,079 --> 00:24:13,240
Township, county, or city?

529
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:14,200
County government.

530
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:15,359
Back in my hometown in Sichuan.

531
00:24:15,400 --> 00:24:16,440
Are you telling the truth?

532
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:17,960
Waiter! Waiter!

533
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:20,880
Boss Lin!

534
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:22,839
I... I...

535
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:24,160
Old Xiao.

536
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:26,640
Don't worry about finding your great-aunt.

537
00:24:26,720 --> 00:24:27,920
He used to be a township head.

538
00:24:28,039 --> 00:24:28,720
We'll definitely get it done.

539
00:24:28,720 --> 00:24:29,240
Consider it done.

540
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:31,079
Old Xiao!

541
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:31,839
Section Chief Xiao.

542
00:24:32,880 --> 00:24:34,200
You came to Minzhong and didn't even call me.

543
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:35,440
Afraid I didn't have money to buy you a drink?

544
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:36,319
No, no, no.

545
00:24:36,319 --> 00:24:36,960
Let's go.

546
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:38,400
Let me introduce you to some of my guys.

547
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:39,640
You flatter me. You flatter me.

548
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:42,160
Next time, let's invite Director Wu.

549
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:42,880
How about that?

550
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:43,640
Sounds good.

551
00:24:45,039 --> 00:24:45,720
Take care.

552
00:24:47,480 --> 00:24:48,640
Take care, Mr. Lin.

553
00:24:57,799 --> 00:24:59,480
We look forward to your next visit.

554
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,319
Just got this before getting off work.

555
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:19,240
I've checked it.

556
00:25:19,640 --> 00:25:21,839
Both the video and audio are clear.

557
00:25:22,079 --> 00:25:23,359
You can see the woman's face clearly.

558
00:25:23,720 --> 00:25:25,119
