let's do business together as neighbors.

833
00:42:25,880 --> 00:42:27,519
Aren't you in the clothing trade?

834
00:42:28,519 --> 00:42:29,760
Coming all the way across the sea,

835
00:42:29,760 --> 00:42:31,840
you'd definitely do whatever makes money.

836
00:42:32,639 --> 00:42:34,559
Do you have many tour groups going to Zhangzhou?

837
00:42:35,039 --> 00:42:36,480
We have day trips every day.

838
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:37,320
Do you want to go?

839
00:42:37,519 --> 00:42:39,519
My dad asked me to pray to Lord Guan for him.

840
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:41,039
I'm unfamiliar with the place,

841
00:42:41,360 --> 00:42:43,000
so please show me around if there's a chance.

842
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:44,119
You're welcome anytime.

843
00:42:45,800 --> 00:42:46,800
Let's go together.

844
00:42:46,800 --> 00:42:48,440
I happen to be passing by Heping Street too.

845
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:50,199
No need. You go ahead.

846
00:42:50,199 --> 00:42:52,920
A taxi costs the same for one person anyway.

847
00:42:53,159 --> 00:42:54,119
Wherever you're going, I'll give you a ride.

848
00:42:54,440 --> 00:42:56,360
Thanks, but my boyfriend is picking me up.

849
00:43:01,159 --> 00:43:01,639
Well...

850
00:43:08,559 --> 00:43:09,280
I am Wang Kai.

851
00:43:09,559 --> 00:43:11,079
We invite you to watch the TV series,

852
00:43:11,320 --> 00:43:12,039
"Confrontation".

853
00:43:12,719 --> 00:43:15,000
Secretary Jin Lina went to People's Park.

854
00:43:15,679 --> 00:43:17,800
Lin Kanshan also went to People's Park.

855
00:43:18,079 --> 00:43:20,760
Cao Liaoping also went to People's Park for a run.

856
00:43:20,840 --> 00:43:23,440
And it's right next to the auto city.

857
00:43:23,440 --> 00:43:25,840
All these people went over there.

858
00:43:26,079 --> 00:43:26,719
What a coincidence.

859
00:43:26,920 --> 00:43:27,760
If we play this right,

860
00:43:27,760 --> 00:43:28,840
we'll catch both the small fry and the big fish.

861
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:31,159
Spring Thunder will strike. Courier replaced.

862
00:43:31,159 --> 00:43:32,960
The antique street might have a magic cure.

863
00:43:32,960 --> 00:43:34,679
Destination: South City Antique Street.

864
00:43:34,679 --> 00:43:35,039
Move out.

865
00:43:35,039 --> 00:43:35,599
Yes, sir.

866
00:43:35,719 --> 00:43:36,880
Brother Qi, why the sudden move?

867
00:43:36,880 --> 00:43:38,079
We didn't get any advance notice.
